{
  "id": "JOB.37",
  "number": "37",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 37",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "37",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "37",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At this also my heart trembleth, and is moved out of his place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear attentively the noise of his voice, and the sound",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "goeth out of his mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He directeth it under the whole heaven, and his lightning unto the ends of the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After it a voice roareth: he thundereth with the voice of his excellency; and he will not stay them when his voice is heard.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God thundereth marvellously with his voice; great things doeth he, which we cannot comprehend.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he saith to the snow, Be thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "on",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the earth; likewise to the small rain, and to the great rain of his strength.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He sealeth up the hand of every man; that all men may know his work.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the beasts go into dens, and remain in their places.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Out of the south cometh the whirlwind: and cold out of the north.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By the breath of God frost is given: and the breadth of the waters is straitened.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also by watering he wearieth the thick cloud: he scattereth his bright cloud:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it is turned round about by his counsels: that they may do whatsoever he commandeth them upon the face of the world in the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He causeth it to come, whether for correction, or for his land, or for mercy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hearken unto this, O Job: stand still, and consider the wondrous works of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dost thou know when God disposed them, and caused the light of his cloud to shine?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dost thou know the balancings of the clouds, the wondrous works of him which is perfect in knowledge?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How thy garments",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "warm, when he quieteth the earth by the south",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "wind",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hast thou with him spread out the sky,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "strong,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as a molten looking glass?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teach us what we shall say unto him;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "we cannot order",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "our speech",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by reason of darkness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall it be told him that I speak? if a man speak, surely he shall be swallowed up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "see not the bright light which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the clouds: but the wind passeth, and cleanseth them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fair weather cometh out of the north: with God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "terrible majesty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Touching",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Almighty, we cannot find him out:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.37.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.37.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "excellent in power, and in judgment, and in plenty of justice: he will not afflict.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
